# L §7.1: "A text literal ... in a rule it is refused (LOAD-LITERAL)" (writer 8, OQ-6).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input form: text
def is37: bool = form == "PIT-37"

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  form = "PIT-37"

ask q1: is37
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LITERAL ...
